+In the original pairing `\langle h,k\rangle_{dual}=
+\langle h,(D+\kappa)^{-1}k\rangle_\rho`, direct multiplication gives
+`\langle (D+\kappa)Y,R_can\rangle_dual=0`. Therefore R_can is the
