+    sum_(f:dist(e,f)>=d)||(S_u)_(e,f)||op
+      <=(3/2)R (d+2)/2^(d+1).                            (U19)
+
+Each contributing connected S has |S|>=d+1; (m+1)/2^m decreases for m>=1.
+This spatial estimate keeps every cross-link block and its original support.
